{"v":1,"path":"/Components/ILDMManager/ILDMManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>ILDMManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">ILDMManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">ILDMManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">ILDMManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">LDM（Local Data Mode)管理类，可以用来开启或者关闭LDM模式，LDM开启的时候MSDK的网络访问功能会受限，可以调用enableLDM来开启LDM模式，也可以在开启的时候配置例外模块,允许个别例外模块在LDM开启时任然可以访问网络。例如允许RTK模块在LDM开启时访问RTK服务器以确保定位的精度，或者允许限飞解禁模块在LDM开启时仍然可以访问限飞数据库服务器以确保飞行安全。LDM功能需要先在开发者官网(https://developer.dji.com/user/ldm/)申请，审批通过后才能使用。</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.interfaces\" aria-label=\"复制包名\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"描述：\" style=\"display: none;\">描述：</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">LDM（Local Data Mode)管理类，可以用来开启或者关闭LDM模式，LDM开启的时候MSDK的网络访问功能会受限，可以调用<code><a href=\"ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_enableldm\">enableLDM</a></code>来开启LDM模式，也可以在开启的时候配置例外模块,允许个别例外模块在LDM开启时任然可以访问网络。例如允许RTK模块在LDM开启时访问RTK服务器以确保定位的精度，或者允许限飞解禁模块在LDM开启时仍然可以访问限飞数据库服务器以确保飞行安全。LDM功能需要先在开发者官网(<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://developer.dji.com/user/ldm/\">https://developer.dji.com/user/ldm/</a>)申请，审批通过后才能使用。 <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.0.0开始支持</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>成员</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">8</span> 个成员</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"按名称、参数或描述筛选\" aria-label=\"筛选成员\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"清空搜索\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">方法</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"enum\">枚举</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>方法</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">7</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_isldmlicenseloaded_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"isldmlicenseloaded 调用enableldm接口后，msdk会先判断是否有本地的离线ldm证书文件，没有的话，会请求服务器返回ldm证书文件，如果证书文件成功加载并生效，会返回true.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">isLDMLicenseLoaded</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">调用enableLDM接口后，MSDK会先判断是否有本地的离线LDM证书文件，没有的话，会请求服务器返回LDM证书文件，如果证书文件成功加载并生效，会返回true.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_isldmenabled_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"isldmenabled 返回ldm模式是否开启。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">isLDMEnabled</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">返回LDM模式是否开启。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_isnetworkserviceenabledformodule_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"isnetworkserviceenabledformodule 获取传入的ldmexemptmodule是否有网络访问权限。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">isNetworkServiceEnabledForModule</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取传入的LDMExemptModule是否有网络访问权限。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_loadlocalldmlicensecontent_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"loadlocalldmlicensecontent 加载ldm 证书文件的内容，该内容来源为申请ldm成功后开发者网站返回的license_app包名.txt文件的内容。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">loadLocalLDMLicenseContent</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">加载LDM 证书文件的内容，该内容来源为申请LDM成功后开发者网站返回的license_app包名.txt文件的内容。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_getlocalldmlicensepath_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getlocalldmlicensepath 获取离线ldm证书文件的存储目录。请把离线ldm证书放在此目录下。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getLocalLDMLicensePath</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取离线LDM证书文件的存储目录。请把离线LDM证书放在此目录下。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_enableldm_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"enableldm 开启ldm模式接口，调用此接口时可以传入多个ldmexemptmodule参数，代表ldm开启后任然允许联网的例外模块，举例：调用接口时modules参数包含rtk和fly_safe，则表示ldm开启后，rtk和限飞模块仍然可以访问网络。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">enableLDM</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">开启LDM模式接口，调用此接口时可以传入多个LDMExemptModule参数，代表LDM开启后任然允许联网的例外模块，举例：调用接口时modules参数包含RTK和FLY_SAFE，则表示LDM开启后，RTK和限飞模块仍然可以访问网络。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_disableldm_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"disableldm 关闭ldm模式。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">disableLDM</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">关闭LDM模式。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"enum\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>枚举</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">1</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"ldmexemptmodule ldm例外模块类型，设置ldm例外模块可以正常访问网络。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">LDMExemptModule</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">LDM例外模块类型，设置LDM例外模块可以正常访问网络。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">没有匹配的成员，请尝试更短的关键词。</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ildmmanager_isldmlicenseloaded\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ildmmanager_isldmlicenseloaded_inline\">isLDMLicenseLoaded</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ildmmanager_isldmlicenseloaded_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isLDMLicenseLoaded</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isLDMLicenseLoaded</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">调用<code><a href=\"ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_enableldm\">enableLDM</a></code>接口后，MSDK会先判断是否有本地的离线LDM证书文件，没有的话，会请求服务器返回LDM证书文件，如果证书文件成功加载并生效，会返回<code>true</code>.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true表示LDM证书文件已成功加载并生效。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ildmmanager_isldmenabled\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ildmmanager_isldmenabled_inline\">isLDMEnabled</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ildmmanager_isldmenabled_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isLDMEnabled</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isLDMEnabled</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">返回LDM模式是否开启。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true表示LDM模式已开启。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ildmmanager_isnetworkserviceenabledformodule\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ildmmanager_isnetworkserviceenabledformodule_inline\">isNetworkServiceEnabledForModule</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ildmmanager_isnetworkserviceenabledformodule_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isNetworkServiceEnabledForModule</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isNetworkServiceEnabledForModule</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">LDMExemptModule</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">module</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取传入的LDMExemptModule是否有网络访问权限。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>module</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule\"><span class=\"jv-type\">LDMExemptModule</span></a> </code></span></td><td>LDM例外模块。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true表示LDM没有开启，或者在LDM开启情况下传入的LDMExemptModule任然有网络访问权限。false表示LDM已经开启，并且传入的LDMExemptModule没有网络访问权限。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ildmmanager_loadlocalldmlicensecontent\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ildmmanager_loadlocalldmlicensecontent_inline\">loadLocalLDMLicenseContent</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ildmmanager_loadlocalldmlicensecontent_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>loadLocalLDMLicenseContent</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IDJIError</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">loadLocalLDMLicenseContent</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">content</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">加载LDM 证书文件的内容，该内容来源为申请LDM成功后开发者网站返回的license_app包名.txt文件的内容。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>LDM证书文件的内容，该内容来源为申请LDM成功后开发者网站返回的license_app包名.txt文件的内容。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJIError/DJIError.html#djierror\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IDJIError</span></a></code></span></td><td>返回加载LDM证书文件内容的执行结果。返回null，则表示成功加载证书文件内容。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ildmmanager_getlocalldmlicensepath\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ildmmanager_getlocalldmlicensepath_inline\">getLocalLDMLicensePath</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ildmmanager_getlocalldmlicensepath_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getLocalLDMLicensePath</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getLocalLDMLicensePath</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">ctx</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取离线LDM证书文件的存储目录。请把离线LDM证书放在此目录下。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>ctx</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> </code></span></td><td>当前应用的Context</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span></code></span></td><td>返回离线LDM证书文件的存储目录。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ildmmanager_enableldm\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ildmmanager_enableldm_inline\">enableLDM</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ildmmanager_enableldm_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>enableLDM</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">enableLDM</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">context</span>, <span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span>, <span class=\"jv-type\">LDMExemptModule</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">...</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">modules</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">开启LDM模式接口，调用此接口时可以传入多个LDMExemptModule参数，代表LDM开启后任然允许联网的例外模块，举例：调用接口时modules参数包含RTK和FLY_SAFE，则表示LDM开启后，RTK和限飞模块仍然可以访问网络。<br> </font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>注意</strong><br><br> 1.用此接口开启LDM模式, 需要在<code><a href=\"../SDKManager/DJISDKManager.html#isdkmanager_init\">init</a></code>方法之后调用,如果没有离线的证书文件，则必须传入如下参数：<code><a href=\"ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_msdk_init_and_registration\">MSDK_INIT_AND_REGISTRATION</a></code>，以便让MSDK注册模块可以进行一次联网完成注册流程。<br> 2.使用离线证书文件激活LDM时，需要确保离线的LDM证书文件（license_app包名.txt）已经存放到指定目录，可通过<code><a href=\"ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_getlocalldmlicensepath\">getLocalLDMLicensePath</a></code>获取指定目录。<br> 3.除了把离线的LDM证书文件存放到指定目录的方式外，你也可以调用<code><a href=\"ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_loadlocalldmlicensecontent\">loadLocalLDMLicenseContent</a></code>把Lincese文件的内容加载到LDM模块中。<br> 4.如果没有离线的证书文件，第一次调用本方法时会访问DJI的LDM服务器拉取证书文件信息并保存到本地，之后调用此接口时会首先读取本地保存的信息。<br> 5.想使用LDM离线模式的证书文件，需要去DJI SDK开发者官网<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://developer.dji.com\">https://developer.dji.com</a>登录个人账号后申请。<br> <br><br></font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\"><b>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>context</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> </code></span></td><td>传入一个Application的Context.</td></tr><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>返回执行结果的回调。</td></tr><tr><td><code>modules</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule\"><span class=\"jv-type\">LDMExemptModule</span></a><span class=\"jv-punct\">...</span> </code></span></td><td>如果希望某几个模块在LDM开启时作为例外模块，仍然可以访问网络，则在modules中设置此模块。</td></tr></tbody></table></b></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><b>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ildmmanager_disableldm\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ildmmanager_disableldm_inline\">disableLDM</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ildmmanager_disableldm_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>disableLDM</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">disableLDM</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">关闭LDM模式。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>返回执行结果的回调。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<h5 id=\"Related\">Related:</h5>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">enum</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_inline\">LDMExemptModule</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">enum</span><h3>LDMExemptModule</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">enum</span> <span class=\"title class_\">LDMExemptModule</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.common.ldm</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">LDM例外模块类型，设置LDM例外模块可以正常访问网络。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">枚举成员</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_msdk_init_and_registration_inline\"></a>MSDK_INIT_AND_REGISTRATION</font></code></td><td>MSDK初始化和注册模块。LDM下，MSDK初始化和注册模块以及LDM拉取DJI服务器License功能（调用enableLDM）时可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_live_streaming_inline\"></a>LIVE_STREAMING</font></code></td><td>直播模块。LDM下，直播模块可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_rtk_inline\"></a>RTK</font></code></td><td>RTK模块。LDM下，RTK模块可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_firmware_upgrade_inline\"></a>FIRMWARE_UPGRADE</font></code></td><td>固件升级模块。LDM下，固件升级模块可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_experence_improvement_inline\"></a>EXPERENCE_IMPROVEMENT</font></code></td><td>产品改进计划模块。LDM下，产品改进计划模块可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_user_account_inline\"></a>USER_ACCOUNT</font></code></td><td>用户账号模块。LDM下，用户账号模块可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_lte_inline\"></a>LTE</font></code></td><td>LTE模块。LDM下，LTE模块可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_fly_safe_inline\"></a>FLY_SAFE</font></code></td><td>限飞模块。LDM下，限飞模块可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_real_name_inline\"></a>REAL_NAME</font></code></td><td>实名制模块。LDM下，实名制模块可以正常访问网络。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_oid_inline\"></a>OID</font></code></td><td>LDM下，OID功能正常访问网络。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></b></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><b><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></b></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">本页目录</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">概览</a></li><li><a href=\"#类成员\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">成员索引</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">方法</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_isldmlicenseloaded\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_isldmlicenseloaded\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>isLDMLicenseLoaded</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_isldmenabled\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_isldmenabled\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>isLDMEnabled</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_isnetworkserviceenabledformodule\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_isnetworkserviceenabledformodule\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>isNetworkServiceEnabledForModule</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_loadlocalldmlicensecontent\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_loadlocalldmlicensecontent\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>loadLocalLDMLicenseContent</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_getlocalldmlicensepath\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_getlocalldmlicensepath\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getLocalLDMLicensePath</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_enableldm\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_enableldm\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>enableLDM</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_disableldm\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_disableldm\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>disableLDM</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">相关类型</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-related\"><a href=\"#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule\" data-target=\"ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-enum\">E</span>LDMExemptModule</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      ","buildId":"1795058050072"}